{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":481006,"duration_api_ms":482364,"num_turns":5,"result":"I have all the information needed. Let me now generate the comprehensive worst-tier imagined results for all non-done plans.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: |\n  核心 reframe：从 \"universal emergent property\" 转向 \"measurement framework + conditional phenomenon\"。\n  C5 LLaMA pilot 明确失败——无 phase gradient 且方向微弱反转，列为 negative result / future work。\n  C2 Qwen s015 n=500 后 CI 仍跨零、效应量缩水——从 claim 中移除，叙事改为 s≥020 三水平。\n  DeepSeek n=500 效应量普遍缩水 ~15-20%（n=50 采样偏高），CI 收窄仅 12-18%（远低于理论 ~70%）。\n  Title 聚焦 \"When Does Compound Interaction Become Phase-Dependent?\"——从 statement 变 question。\n  方法论贡献（II metric + paired permutation test）成为论文第一核心价值，现象发现降为第二。\n  仍冲 EMNLP Findings track：empirical finding + negative result + methodology 组合有先例。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ================================================================\n  # RUNNING EXPERIMENTS — 需要预测完整结果\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"DeepSeek n=500 statistical power boost\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek 8 conditions (imp/rand × 4 sparsity) 从 n=50 扩到 n=500 (full MATH-500)\"\n    expected_results:\n      # importance — paired median diff 全部缩水 ~15-20%\n      ds_imp_s015_n500_median_diff: 0.25\n      ds_imp_s015_n500_ci_95: [0.18, 0.33]\n      ds_imp_s015_n500_cohens_d: 0.52\n      ds_imp_s015_n500_permutation_p: 0.0001\n      ds_imp_s020_n500_median_diff: 0.95\n      ds_imp_s020_n500_ci_95: [0.72, 1.18]\n      ds_imp_s020_n500_cohens_d: 0.68\n      ds_imp_s025_n500_median_diff: 3.45\n      ds_imp_s025_n500_ci_95: [2.80, 4.15]\n      ds_imp_s025_n500_cohens_d: 0.88\n      ds_imp_s030_n500_median_diff: 8.80\n      ds_imp_s030_n500_ci_95: [7.50, 10.40]\n      ds_imp_s030_n500_cohens_d: 1.05\n      # random — 仍全部 FAIL\n      ds_rand_s015_n500_median_diff: 0.008\n      ds_rand_s015_n500_permutation_p: 0.82\n      ds_rand_s020_n500_median_diff: -0.012\n      ds_rand_s020_n500_permutation_p: 0.65\n      ds_rand_s025_n500_median_diff: 0.42\n      ds_rand_s025_n500_permutation_p: 0.52\n      ds_rand_s030_n500_median_diff: 1.35\n      ds_rand_s030_n500_permutation_p: 0.10\n      # CI width reduction\n      ds_s015_ci_width_reduction_pct: 12\n      ds_s020_ci_width_reduction_pct: 15\n      ds_s025_ci_width_reduction_pct: 18\n      ds_s030_ci_width_reduction_pct: 16\n    result_rationale: |\n      n=500 增加统计功效但不改变 true effect size。Worst 档下 s015 的 median_diff 从 \n      n=50 的 0.32 回归至 0.25——n=50 的 0.32 包含了采样方差带来的高估（regression to mean），\n      更大样本量暴露了 true effect 比初始点估计低约 20%。\n      CI 收窄仅 12-18%（远低于 sqrt(500/50)≈3.16× 的理论收窄），原因是 per-problem 方差\n      高度异质：MATH-500 中约 30% 的问题推理链 <100 tokens，phase 划分不稳定（high/low 各仅\n      2-3 segments），这些\"噪声问题\"在 n=50 时被少量采样掩盖，n=500 时大量出现并拉宽了 bootstrap CI。\n      s020-s030 效应量下降 11-17%（1.15→0.95, 3.97→3.45, 9.94→8.80），这在统计上不改变显著性\n      但叙事上意味着论文中的 headline 数字必须全部替换为更保守的 n=500 版本。\n      审稿人可能追问：\"n=50 的数字为何更大？是否存在 selective reporting？\"\n      Random masking 仍全 FAIL，这一核心对比不受样本量影响，是最稳健的信号。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: DeepSeek importance — n=50 vs n=500 paired median difference\"\n        content: |\n          | Sparsity | median_diff (n=50) | median_diff (n=500) | Δ% | CI_95 (n=500) | Cohen's d | p |\n          |----------|-------------------|--------------------|----|---------------|-----------|---|\n          | s015 | 0.32 | 0.25 | -22% | [0.18, 0.33] | 0.52 | <0.001 |\n          | s020 | 1.15 | 0.95 | -17% | [0.72, 1.18] | 0.68 | <0.001 |\n          | s025 | 3.97 | 3.45 | -13% | [2.80, 4.15] | 0.88 | <0.001 |\n          | s030 | 9.94 | 8.80 | -11% | [7.50, 10.40] | 1.05 | <0.001 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: n=50 vs n=500 paired median diff 对比 + CI shrinkage，显示 regression to mean\"\n      - \"Fig: Per-problem token length distribution (n=500)，标注短推理链问题的比例和影响\"\n    analysis: |\n      DeepSeek n=500 在 worst 档下仍保持全 4 水平 Bonferroni 显著，核心发现稳健。\n      但效应量普遍缩水 ~15% 是叙事层面的问题：论文从 \"0.32→9.94\" 改为 \"0.25→8.80\"，\n      增长比从 31× 降为 35× 变化不大，但绝对值更保守。\n      CI 收窄远不及预期（12-18% vs 理论 ~70%）意味着 RC4 的统计功效质疑\n      无法完全消除——必须在 appendix 加入 per-problem 方差异质性分析（短推理链效应）。\n      正面：random 仍全 FAIL，importance vs random 的 contrast 不依赖样本量。\n\n  - name: \"Qwen n=500 statistical power boost\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"Qwen 8 conditions (imp/rand × 4 sparsity) 从 n=50 扩到 n=500\"\n    expected_results:\n      # importance — s015 CI 仍跨零\n      qw_imp_s015_n500_median_diff: 0.035\n      qw_imp_s015_n500_ci_95: [-0.012, 0.088]\n      qw_imp_s015_n500_cohens_d: 0.28\n      qw_imp_s015_n500_permutation_p: 0.048\n      qw_imp_s020_n500_median_diff: 0.18\n      qw_imp_s020_n500_ci_95: [0.055, 0.32]\n      qw_imp_s020_n500_cohens_d: 0.62\n      qw_imp_s020_n500_permutation_p: 0.0003\n      qw_imp_s025_n500_median_diff: 0.95\n      qw_imp_s025_n500_ci_95: [0.52, 1.35]\n      qw_imp_s025_n500_cohens_d: 1.10\n      qw_imp_s025_n500_permutation_p: \"<0.0001\"\n      qw_imp_s030_n500_median_diff: 2.35\n      qw_imp_s030_n500_ci_95: [1.55, 3.20]\n      qw_imp_s030_n500_cohens_d: 1.32\n      qw_imp_s030_n500_permutation_p: \"<0.0001\"\n      # random — 全 FAIL 但 s030 边缘\n      qw_rand_s015_n500_median_diff: -0.025\n      qw_rand_s015_n500_permutation_p: 0.78\n      qw_rand_s020_n500_median_diff: 0.10\n      qw_rand_s020_n500_permutation_p: 0.38\n      qw_rand_s025_n500_median_diff: 0.85\n      qw_rand_s025_n500_permutation_p: 0.21\n      qw_rand_s030_n500_median_diff: 2.20\n      qw_rand_s030_n500_permutation_p: 0.015\n      qw_rand_s030_n500_cohens_d: -0.04\n      # CI width reduction\n      qw_s015_ci_width_reduction_pct: 8\n      qw_s020_ci_width_reduction_pct: 14\n      qw_s025_ci_width_reduction_pct: 17\n      qw_s030_ci_width_reduction_pct: 15\n    result_rationale: |\n      Qwen s015 是 worst 档的核心痛点。n=50 时 CI 已跨零 [-0.005, 0.110]，\n      n=500 后 CI 收窄至 [-0.012, 0.088] 但仍跨零——下界从 -0.005 降至 -0.012，\n      因为更大样本暴露了 Qwen 特有的推理链长度异质性：Qwen 平均推理链比 DeepSeek 短 ~30%，\n      导致 low-sparsity phase token 数不足（部分 problem 的 low phase 仅 1-2 segments），\n      II 估计噪声极大。median_diff 从 0.048 缩至 0.035（-27%），效应量缩水比 DeepSeek 更严重，\n      说明 Qwen s015 的 true effect 本就接近检测限（detection floor）。\n      permutation p=0.048 勉强 <0.05 但 Bonferroni 校正后（4 comparisons, threshold 0.0125）\n      不显著——s015 被排除出 claim。s020 CI 刚好 exclude zero [0.055, 0.32]，成为 Qwen onset。\n      s025/s030 稳健但 magnitude 仍为 DeepSeek 的 ~1/4（0.95 vs 3.45, 2.35 vs 8.80）。\n      额外风险：random s030 permutation p=0.015 接近 Bonferroni threshold，虽然 Cohen's d=-0.04\n      可忽略，但审稿人可能论证 Qwen s030 上 random 也出现了微弱 gradient，\n      质疑效应是否 truly strategy-specific 还是 high sparsity 下的 floor effect。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Qwen importance — n=50 vs n=500 paired median difference\"\n        content: |\n          | Sparsity | med_diff (n=50) | med_diff (n=500) | Δ% | CI_95 (n=500) | d | p | Bonf |\n          |----------|----------------|------------------|----|---------------|-----|-------|------|\n          | s015 | 0.048 | 0.035 | -27% | [-0.012, 0.088] | 0.28 | 0.048 | NO |\n          | s020 | 0.208 | 0.18 | -13% | [0.055, 0.32] | 0.62 | <0.001 | YES |\n          | s025 | 1.109 | 0.95 | -14% | [0.52, 1.35] | 1.10 | <0.001 | YES |\n          | s030 | 2.619 | 2.35 | -10% | [1.55, 3.20] | 1.32 | <0.001 | YES |\n      - caption: \"Table: Qwen random n=500 — s030 marginal\"\n        content: |\n          | Sparsity | rand med_diff | rand p | rand d | Strategy-specific? |\n          |----------|--------------|--------|--------|-------------------|\n          | s015 | -0.025 | 0.78 | ~0 | YES (FAIL) |\n          | s020 | 0.10 | 0.38 | ~0 | YES (FAIL) |\n          | s025 | 0.85 | 0.21 | ~0 | YES (FAIL) |\n          | s030 | 2.20 | 0.015 | -0.04 | MARGINAL |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Qwen CI forest plot, 标注 s015 跨零 + s020 onset threshold\"\n      - \"Fig: Qwen random s030 per-problem scatter, 显示 p=0.015 但 d≈0 的解离\"\n    analysis: |\n      Qwen s015 确认为 noise——n=500 未能 rescue。叙事必须放弃 \"all 4 sparsity levels \n      significant for both models\"，改为 \"onset at s≥020 for Qwen (3 levels)\"。\n      更大的叙事问题：(1) Qwen magnitude 持续 ~1/4 of DeepSeek，审稿人可论证\n      这只是 DeepSeek distillation 的 artifact 而非 architecture property；\n      (2) random s030 接近 Bonferroni 边缘，虽然 d≈0 但 p 值本身会引起注意——\n      需要在 §4 Results 中主动解释 \"statistical significance ≠ practical significance\"。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # PLANNED EXPERIMENTS — 需要预测完整结果\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"LLaMA-8B cross-architecture validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B 上复现 phase-modulated compound severity。pilot-first: s025/s030 两水平 + oracle/heuristic phase proxy\"\n    expected_results:\n      # importance — 无 phase gradient\n      llama_imp_s025_paired_median_diff: -0.12\n      llama_imp_s025_ci_95: [-0.65, 0.18]\n      llama_imp_s025_cohens_d: -0.08\n      llama_imp_s025_permutation_p: 0.72\n      llama_imp_s030_paired_median_diff: 0.15\n      llama_imp_s030_ci_95: [-0.40, 0.85]\n      llama_imp_s030_cohens_d: 0.12\n      llama_imp_s030_permutation_p: 0.35\n      # per-phase II — flat 或微弱反转\n      llama_ii_high_s025_median: 0.45\n      llama_ii_mid_s025_median: 0.52\n      llama_ii_low_s025_median: 0.38\n      llama_ii_high_s030_median: 1.20\n      llama_ii_mid_s030_median: 1.55\n      llama_ii_low_s030_median: 1.35\n      # crossover\n      llama_crossover_present: false\n      # heuristic\n      llama_heuristic_phase_correlation: 0.15\n      llama_oracle_recovery_pct: 8\n      llama_heuristic_recovery_pct: 3\n      llama_gate_pass: false\n      # mechanism indicators\n      llama_gini_delta_s025: -0.015\n      llama_gini_delta_s030: -0.022\n      llama_cv_delta_s025: -0.35\n      llama_cv_delta_s030: -0.52\n      llama_entropy_delta_s025: -0.008\n      llama_entropy_delta_s030: -0.012\n      # baseline II levels\n      llama_n_problems: 50\n      llama_total_tokens: 78500\n    result_rationale: |\n      LLaMA-8B pilot 完全失败，基于以下架构层面的原因：\n      (1) Attention score 分布差异：LLaMA 的 RoPE implementation 使 attention score 天然更 uniform\n      （baseline Gini ~0.35 vs Qwen2 的 ~0.52），importance score 的判别力基线就低。\n      Head pruning 造成的 Gini delta 仅 -0.015（DeepSeek: -0.065, Qwen: -0.010），\n      discrimination collapse 的绝对幅度不足以产生 phase-dependent severity gradient。\n      (2) GQA 分组效应：LLaMA-8B 的 GQA 使得 head pruning 按组生效（4 heads/group），\n      组内 head 冗余度高，pruning 对 importance 分布的扰动被组内补偿吸收。\n      (3) Distillation 未改变 attention pattern：虽然 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B 经过 distillation，\n      但 distillation 只改变了 output distribution（reasoning style），并未改变底层 attention \n      mechanism 的 structural properties——LLaMA attention 的 uniform bias 依然存在。\n      (4) s025 出现微弱方向反转（high phase median 0.45 > low phase median 0.38），\n      s030 方向正确但 CI 宽且跨零——两个水平都在 noise range 内。\n      Oracle recovery 仅 8%（远低于 30% gate）：即使有完美 phase information，\n      LLaMA 上也几乎无法通过 phase-aware budgeting 改善 compound degradation，\n      因为 degradation 本身就不是 phase-dependent 的。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: LLaMA-8B pilot results vs DeepSeek/Qwen baseline\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | Arch | s025 med_diff | s025 d | s030 med_diff | s030 d | Crossover | Gate |\n          |-------|------|--------------|--------|--------------|--------|-----------|------|\n          | DeepSeek | Qwen2 | 3.97 | 0.95 | 9.94 | 1.13 | YES | N/A |\n          | Qwen | Qwen2 | 1.11 | 1.23 | 2.62 | 1.44 | YES | N/A |\n          | LLaMA | LLaMA | -0.12 | -0.08 | 0.15 | 0.12 | NO | FAIL |\n      - caption: \"Table: Discrimination collapse indicator comparison\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | Gini Δ (s025) | CV Δ (s025) | Entropy Δ (s025) | Sufficient collapse? |\n          |-------|--------------|-------------|------------------|---------------------|\n          | DeepSeek | -0.065 | -1.287 | -0.045 | YES |\n          | Qwen | -0.010 | -1.491 | +0.045 | PARTIAL |\n          | LLaMA | -0.015 | -0.350 | -0.008 | NO |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 三模型 phase gradient 对比——DeepSeek 强单调递增, Qwen 弱递增, LLaMA flat\"\n      - \"Fig: Gini delta × phase gradient scatter (3 models)——视觉化 collapse 幅度与 gradient 关联\"\n    analysis: |\n      C5 gate 明确 FAIL。LLaMA 无 phase gradient（两水平均 CI 跨零），无 crossover，\n      oracle recovery 8% < 30% gate threshold。confirmed_arch_families = 1（仅 Qwen2ForCausalLM）。\n      叙事影响：(1) paper title 必须从 statement 改为 question；\n      (2) C5 列为 \"Negative result: LLaMA does not exhibit phase-dependent compound severity\"；\n      (3) Gini delta 对比提供 mechanistic boundary condition：\n      discrimination collapse 幅度与 phase gradient 存在关联，LLaMA 的低 baseline Gini \n      使得 pruning-induced collapse 不足以触发 phase-dependent severity——\n      这是有科学价值的 boundary condition 分析，不是单纯的 \"没发现\"。\n\n  - name: \"Phase-aware mitigation pilot (oracle + heuristic)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"2h pilot: oracle phase assignment + token position ratio heuristic on s025/s030, 测量 compound degradation recovery\"\n    expected_results:\n      # DeepSeek\n      ds_oracle_recovery_s025_pct: 22\n      ds_oracle_recovery_s030_pct: 18\n      ds_heuristic_recovery_s025_pct: 9\n      ds_heuristic_recovery_s030_pct: 7\n      # Qwen\n      qw_oracle_recovery_s025_pct: 15\n      qw_oracle_recovery_s030_pct: 12\n      qw_heuristic_recovery_s025_pct: 5\n      qw_heuristic_recovery_s030_pct: 4\n      # heuristic quality\n      heuristic_phase_accuracy_ds: 0.61\n      heuristic_phase_accuracy_qw: 0.55\n      heuristic_phase_accuracy_mean: 0.58\n      # gate\n      gate_threshold: 30\n      gate_pass: false\n    result_rationale: |\n      Mitigation pilot 失败有两层原因：\n      (1) Proxy 质量差：token position ratio 作为 phase proxy 准确率仅 58%——\n      reasoning chain 的 phase 边界与 token position 不单调对齐。模型在输出中段经常\n      \"回溯\"（\"wait, let me reconsider...\"）回到 reasoning phase，\n      也可能在前段提前进入 execution phase（\"The answer is 42. Let me verify...\"），\n      这种非线性 phase structure 使得任何 monotone position-based proxy 都有 ~40% error rate。\n      (2) Recovery 上限低：即使 oracle（完美 phase assignment），recovery 也仅 18-22%（DeepSeek）。\n      这是因为 compound interaction = pruning effect + eviction effect + coupling term，\n      phase-aware budgeting 只调整 eviction budget（改变每个 phase 保留多少 KV cache），\n      不改变 pruning ratio。而在高 sparsity 下 pruning contribution 占 compound degradation \n      的 60-70%（可从 attn-only 实验的 ppl 推算），因此 eviction-side 的优化天花板低。\n      Qwen recovery 更低（12-15%）是因为 Qwen 的 phase gradient 本身就弱（magnitude ~1/4），\n      phase-aware reallocation 的潜在收益更小。\n      Gate: max recovery 22% < 30% threshold → FAIL → mitigation 标记为 future work。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Mitigation pilot recovery rates\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | Sparsity | Oracle Recovery | Heuristic Recovery | Gate (>30%) |\n          |-------|----------|----------------|-------------------|-------------|\n          | DeepSeek | s025 | 22% | 9% | FAIL |\n          | DeepSeek | s030 | 18% | 7% | FAIL |\n          | Qwen | s025 | 15% | 5% | FAIL |\n          | Qwen | s030 | 12% | 4% | FAIL |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Recovery rate bar chart with 30% gate threshold line\"\n    analysis: |\n      Mitigation pilot 失败在 worst 档下强化了 \"measurement > method\" 定位。\n      论文仅报告 oracle upper bound 作为 ceiling analysis，不 claim practical mitigation。\n      Discussion 中需要回应 \"so what?\"：\n      (1) 知道 severity 在哪里最大本身指导 deployment（避免 low-sparsity phase 用 compound）；\n      (2) oracle-heuristic gap (22% vs 9%) 证明更好的 phase proxy 有 improvement headroom；\n      (3) pruning contribution 分析指向 \"joint phase-aware pruning + eviction\" 作为 future direction。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # ANALYSIS TASKS — 基于已有数据，预测分析结论\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Crossover analysis from plan_001 + plan_002\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"从 bf16 importance vs random 数据中提取 per-phase II，验证方向反转\"\n    expected_results:\n      # DeepSeek crossover — 已有数据支持\n      ds_crossover_s025_confirmed: true\n      ds_imp_high_s025_median_ii: 0.032\n      ds_imp_low_s025_median_ii: 7.196\n      ds_rand_high_s025_median_ii: 0.818\n      ds_rand_low_s025_median_ii: 1.363\n      ds_crossover_point: \"between high and mid phase\"\n      # Qwen crossover — 模糊\n      qw_crossover_s025_present: false\n      qw_imp_high_s025_median_ii: 1.604\n      qw_imp_low_s025_median_ii: 2.264\n      qw_rand_high_s025_median_ii: 1.604\n      qw_rand_low_s025_median_ii: 2.264\n      qw_crossover_note: \"imp/rand per-phase values too close for clear crossing\"\n      # LLaMA — 无\n      llama_crossover_confirmed: false\n    result_rationale: |\n      DeepSeek crossover 基于已完成的 bf16 数据（bf16_importance_s025: high median 0.032, \n      low median 7.196; bf16_ds_rand_s025: high median 0.818, low median 1.363），\n      方向反转明确：importance 在 high phase 低于 random (0.032 < 0.818)，\n      在 low phase 高于 random (7.196 > 1.363)。\n      Qwen crossover 在 worst 档下不成立：Qwen random s025 的 per-phase median II \n      差异较小（high: 1.60, low: 2.26），importance 也类似（high: 1.60, low: 2.26 from registry），\n      两条线几乎平行而非交叉——Qwen 上 importance 和 random 的 per-phase profile \n      形状相似（都微弱递增），只是 importance 的斜率略大。\n      这意味着 crossover 是 DeepSeek-specific：只有在 DeepSeek 的 extreme contrast \n      (importance high phase 几乎为零 vs random 显著正值) 下才出现明确交叉。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Per-phase II — importance vs random at s025\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | Strategy | High phase | Mid phase | Low phase | Crossover? |\n          |-------|----------|-----------|-----------|-----------|-----------|\n          | DeepSeek | Importance | 0.032 | 1.118 | 7.196 | — |\n          | DeepSeek | Random | 0.818 | 0.932 | 1.363 | YES ✓ |\n          | Qwen | Importance | 1.604 | 2.222 | 2.264 | — |\n          | Qwen | Random | 1.604 | 2.222 | 2.264 | NO ✗ |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Interaction plot (strategy × phase) for DeepSeek showing clear crossover\"\n      - \"Fig: Interaction plot for Qwen showing parallel lines (no crossover)\"\n    analysis: |\n      C3 从 \"confirmed\" 降级为 \"confirmed on DeepSeek only\"。\n      Qwen 的 parallel-lines pattern 意味着 Qwen 上 importance vs random 的差异\n      是 magnitude shift（整体偏移）而非 qualitative interaction（shape change）。\n      论文措辞改为：\"Phase-strategy crossover is observed in DeepSeek where importance \n      masking is near-benign in the high-sparsity phase but severely amplified in the \n      low-sparsity phase. Qwen shows directional consistency without clear crossing.\"\n\n  - name: \"Growth rate analysis from bf16 importance\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"从 bf16 importance 4 sparsity 的 gradient 数据分析增长率模式\"\n    expected_results:\n      # DeepSeek — 单调递减\n      ds_median_diff_sequence: [0.32, 1.15, 3.97, 9.94]\n      ds_growth_factors: [3.59, 3.45, 2.50]\n      ds_growth_monotone_decreasing: true\n      ds_spearman_rho: 1.0\n      # Qwen — 非单调\n      qw_median_diff_sequence: [0.048, 0.208, 1.109, 2.619]\n      qw_growth_factors: [4.33, 5.33, 2.36]\n      qw_growth_monotone_decreasing: false\n      qw_spearman_rho: 1.0\n      qw_non_monotone_note: \"s020→s025 growth factor (5.33) exceeds s015→s020 (4.33)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Growth rate 分析基于已完成 bf16 数据的确定性计算。\n      DeepSeek: 0.32→1.15→3.97→9.94, 增长因子 3.59→3.45→2.50, 严格递减 → sub-exponential confirmed。\n      Qwen: 0.048→0.208→1.109→2.619, 增长因子 4.33→5.33→2.36, 中间 5.33>4.33 破坏单调性。\n      Qwen 的 non-monotone 反映了 onset threshold 效应：s015 的效应量接近 noise floor（CI 跨零），\n      s015→s020 的 \"growth\" 包含了从 noise 到 signal 的 transition，不代表真实增长率。\n      如果从 s020 起算（排除 noise-level s015），Qwen 的 growth factors 为 5.33→2.36，\n      是递减的——但这需要 post-hoc 的 threshold selection，审稿人可能质疑 cherry-picking。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Growth rate analysis\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | s015→020 | s020→025 | s025→030 | Monotone ↓ | Sub-exponential |\n          |-------|----------|----------|----------|-----------|----------------|\n          | DeepSeek | 3.59× | 3.45× | 2.50× | YES | YES |\n          | Qwen | 4.33× | 5.33× | 2.36× | NO | PARTIAL |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      C6 在 worst 档下 split：DeepSeek sub-exponential 成立，Qwen 不严格成立。\n      论文改为 \"sub-exponential growth in DeepSeek; Qwen growth rate non-monotone, \n      likely reflecting noise-to-signal transition at onset threshold\"。\n      或者：将 C6 缩小为 DeepSeek 的 claim，Qwen 的 onset 效应另行讨论。\n\n  - name: \"Per-problem bootstrap CI (bf16 data)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"对 bf16 重跑数据重新做 B=10000 bootstrap CI，统一统计报告格式\"\n    expected_results:\n      ds_all_4_levels_bonferroni_sig: true\n      ds_s015_p: \"<0.001\"\n      ds_s020_p: \"<0.001\"\n      ds_s025_p: \"<0.001\"\n      ds_s030_p: \"<0.001\"\n      qw_s015_bonferroni_sig: false\n      qw_s015_p: 0.0001\n      qw_s015_ci_crosses_zero: true\n      qw_s020_bonferroni_sig: true\n      qw_s025_bonferroni_sig: true\n      qw_s030_bonferroni_sig: true\n      random_ds_all_4_fail: true\n      random_qw_s015_s020_s025_fail: true\n      random_qw_s030_marginal_p: 0.012\n      random_qw_s030_d: -0.04\n    result_rationale: |\n      Bootstrap CI 分析基于已完成的 bf16 permutation test 数据（已有 n=50 结果在 registry），\n      这里是统一格式输出，不会改变已知数字。\n      唯一需要注意的是 Qwen s015 的 permutation p=0.0001 与 bootstrap CI 跨零 [-0.005, 0.110]\n      的表面矛盾：permutation test 测的是 H0: paired median diff = 0（基于 rank），\n      而 bootstrap CI 直接估计点估计的分布。两者的差异来自 per-problem II 分布的重尾性——\n      几个极端 problem 使得 bootstrap 分布右偏、CI 下界被拉低。\n      这个不一致需要在方法学注释中解释，否则审稿人会质疑统计框架的 coherence。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Unified statistical summary (bf16, n=50)\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | Sparsity | Strategy | med_diff | CI_95 | perm_p | d_z | Bonf |\n          |-------|----------|----------|---------|-------|--------|-----|------|\n          | DS | s015 | importance | 0.32 | [0.20, 0.47] | <0.001 | 0.61 | YES |\n          | DS | s020 | importance | 1.15 | [0.66, 1.26] | <0.001 | 0.73 | YES |\n          | DS | s025 | importance | 3.97 | [2.83, 5.29] | <0.001 | 0.95 | YES |\n          | DS | s030 | importance | 9.94 | [8.39, 16.65] | <0.001 | 1.13 | YES |\n          | QW | s015 | importance | 0.048 | [-0.005, 0.110] | <0.001 | 0.37 | NO* |\n          | QW | s020 | importance | 0.208 | [0.067, 0.402] | <0.001 | 0.72 | YES |\n          | QW | s025 | importance | 1.109 | [0.609, 1.469] | <0.001 | 1.23 | YES |\n          | QW | s030 | importance | 2.619 | [1.722, 3.651] | <0.001 | 1.44 | YES |\n          | DS | all | random | — | — | >0.05 | — | FAIL |\n          | QW | s030 | random | 2.42 | [0.24, 3.31] | 0.012 | -0.04 | FAIL** |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Forest plot with all 8 importance conditions + gate annotations\"\n    analysis: |\n      统计汇总确认核心 pattern：DS 全显著, QW s015 CI 跨零但 p 显著（需方法学注释），\n      QW random s030 PASS with negligible effect size（需主动 address）。\n      *Qwen s015 注释：permutation p < CI 的矛盾源于 heavy-tailed per-problem distribution。\n      **Qwen random s030 注释：p=0.012 但 d=-0.04, 解读为 \"statistically detectable, \n      practically negligible phase gradient in random condition\"。\n\n  # ================================================================\n  # WRITING TASK\n  # ================================================================\n  - name: \"Related Work differentiation: Lethe + SparK\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"§2 Related Work 加引用区分 Lethe (layer-time-adaptive KV pruning) 和 SparK (compound compression)，建立 gap\"\n    expected_results:\n      lethe_distinction_clear: true\n      spark_gap_identified: true\n      unicomp_adakv_positioned: true\n      gap_argument_strength: \"moderate\"\n      gap_weakness: \"three-way interaction only fully demonstrated on one architecture\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      写作任务不涉及数据，但 gap 论证的强度取决于实验证据。Worst 档下：\n      (1) Lethe 区分清晰：Lethe 做 layer-time-adaptive KV pruning（单轴 phase-aware），\n      我们做 compound (pruning+eviction) × phase × strategy 三维交互分析——\n      维度不同，无直接竞争。但审稿人可能认为 Lethe 的 time dimension ≈ our phase dimension，\n      需要明确论证 phase ≠ time layer。\n      (2) SparK 对比最强：SparK 做 joint compound compression 但隐含假设 interaction 均匀。\n      我们发现 interaction 是 phase-dependent 的，直接挑战了 SparK 的核心假设——\n      即使现象只在 Qwen2 架构上成立，也足以证明 SparK 假设不 universal。\n      (3) 整体 gap strength 为 \"moderate\"：三维交互的完整 evidence 仅限 DeepSeek，\n      Qwen 为弱复制（magnitude 1/4, onset s≥020），LLaMA 无效。\n      审稿人可反驳：\"你们发现的只是 DeepSeek 的特异现象，不足以挑战 general compound assumption\"。\n      应对：(a) 即使一个反例也足以否定 universal claim；(b) measurement framework 有独立价值。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      Related Work gap 在 worst 档下依赖两个支柱：\n      (1) SparK 均匀假设的反例（即使只有 DeepSeek）；\n      (2) measurement framework（II metric + paired test）的方法论贡献。\n      需要在 §2 末尾明确 position：\"Our contribution is twofold: a measurement framework \n      for detecting phase-dependent compound interaction, and empirical evidence that such \n      interaction exists conditionally (architecture-dependent, with boundary conditions).\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"91a4aa4b-eb9d-422f-9ad2-82e8284aeafd","total_cost_usd":1.0514317499999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":51641,"cache_read_input_tokens":138283,"output_tokens":25497,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":51641,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":10923,"cache_read_input_tokens":48154,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14934,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14934},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":22004,"outputTokens"